#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_active_damping.ipynb:20002
#: 9149cce7479142b199794932f55269a5
msgid ""
"Active Damping for 6-DOF Active Vibration Isolation System (Non-Collocated "
"Configuration)"
msgstr "6自由度アクティブ防振装置のアクティブダンピング (非コロケート配置)"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_active_damping.ipynb:20004
#: 6cac7962a5584244befd543675a746a7
msgid ""
"This tutorial demonstrates an end-to-end workflow combining `gwexpy` and "
"`python-control` to perform simulation, system identification, and control "
"design for a multi-degree-of-freedom (MIMO) system."
msgstr ""
"このチュートリアルでは、`gwexpy` と `python-control` "
"を組み合わせて、多自由度（MIMO）システムのシミュレーション、システム同定、そして制御系設計を行う一連の流れを実演します。"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_active_damping.ipynb:20006
#: 9498a0319c3e47de8a3766508ce6a26f
msgid ""
"**Scenario:** We consider an equilateral triangular vibration isolation "
"platform supported by three legs (6-DOF rigid body). In this case, we deal "
"with a **non-collocated configuration where actuators and sensors are "
"located at different positions**."
msgstr ""
"**シナリオ:** 3つの足で支持された正三角形の防振台（6自由度剛体）を想定します。 "
"今回は、**アクチュエータとセンサーの位置が異なる（非コロケート）** 構成を扱います。"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_active_damping.ipynb:20009
#: 2e94a88f302946b9a43373dad0c48250
msgid ""
"**Actuators**: Located at the three leg positions (support points) at "
"$0^\\circ, 120^\\circ, 240^\\circ$"
msgstr "**アクチュエータ**: 3つの足の位置（支持点）に設置 ($0^\\circ, 120^\\circ, 240^\\circ$)"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_active_damping.ipynb:20010
#: 6cda1c5155384aba9cffee24bdeead8c
msgid ""
"**Sensors**: Located at mid-points between the legs at $60^\\circ, "
"180^\\circ, 300^\\circ$"
msgstr "**センサー**: 足と足の中間地点に設置 ($60^\\circ, 180^\\circ, 300^\\circ$)"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_active_damping.ipynb:20012
#: cc0c23a9aac143c7a82bb28aa0a572eb
msgid ""
"When the input/output positions are misaligned like this, simple independent"
" control for each axis does not work well. Therefore, we perform controller "
"design in **Modal Space**."
msgstr ""
"このように入出力位置がずれている場合、単純な各軸独立制御ではうまくいかないため、**モード空間（Modal Space）** での制御器設計を行います。"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_active_damping.ipynb:20014
#: 1c6cc8da87134112918852cdb3ca7d78
msgid "**Steps:**"
msgstr "**ステップ:**"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_active_damping.ipynb:20015
#: c85493be9087492bbad22cb210d55a2e
msgid ""
"**Physical Model Construction**: Create a state-space model considering "
"sensor and actuator placement."
msgstr "**物理モデルの構築**: センサー・アクチュエータ配置を考慮した状態空間モデルを作成します。"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_active_damping.ipynb:20016
#: 8ecdbed510cb4872870c8b2edab9f0ad
msgid ""
"**MIMO Transfer Function Measurement**: Visualize the transfer function "
"matrix including off-diagonal components using `FrequencySeriesMatrix`."
msgstr "**MIMO伝達関数の測定**: `FrequencySeriesMatrix` で非対角成分を含む伝達関数行列を可視化します。"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_active_damping.ipynb:20017
#: cfe9c1fa486a4baea0aa47350f36a30f
msgid ""
"**System Identification**: Define a control model from physical parameters "
"and geometric configuration."
msgstr "**システム同定**: 物理パラメータと幾何学配置から制御用モデルを定義します。"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_active_damping.ipynb:20018
#: 1369b136bfe148c8a103f71f30f54684
msgid ""
"**Damping Controller Design**: Design \"modal control\" that converts sensor"
" signals to modal coordinates and applies damping to each mode."
msgstr "**ダンピング制御器の設計**: センサー信号をモード座標に変換し、モードごとにダンピングをかける「モード制御」を設計します。"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_active_damping.ipynb:20019
#: ec63f3ba14f44cf79aad5d6db18f979a
msgid ""
"**Closed-Loop Verification**: Confirm vibration suppression performance "
"through impulse response and ASD comparison."
msgstr "**閉ループ検証**: インパルス応答とASD比較により制振性能を確認します。"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_active_damping.ipynb:40002
#: cf35586850a04e599abc3603ecaaa034
msgid "1. Simulation of 6-DOF Active Vibration Isolation System (Plant Model)"
msgstr "1\\. 6自由度アクティブ防振装置のシミュレーション (Plant Model)"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_active_damping.ipynb:40004
#: 054b6d12a2424f77bce670aa44eb26f7
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"We define the rigid body equation of motion $M \\ddot{q} + C \\dot{q} + K q "
"= F$. Here we focus on the three vertical degrees of freedom ($z, \\theta_x,"
" \\theta_y$)."
msgstr ""
"剛体の運動方程式 $M \\ddot{q} + C \\dot{q} + K q = F$ を定義します。 ここでは垂直3自由度（$z, "
"\\theta_x, \\theta_y$）に焦点を当てます。"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_active_damping.ipynb:40007
#: 0000416c9b2a4f5a81325417db0487a7
msgid ""
"**Coordinate Transformation:** For modal coordinates $q = [z, \\theta_x, "
"\\theta_y]^T$,"
msgstr "**座標変換:** モード座標 $q = [z, \\theta_x, \\theta_y]^T$ に対し、"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_active_damping.ipynb:40009
#: 876b0b449489456187146d48ef0b4eb8
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Actuator physical coordinates $p_{act}$: $0^\\circ, 120^\\circ, 240^\\circ$"
msgstr "アクチュエータ物理座標 $p_{act}$: $0^\\circ, 120^\\circ, 240^\\circ$"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_active_damping.ipynb:40010
#: e6351d17ee7f470c91b75fd89c73d4ee
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Sensor physical coordinates $p_{sen}$: $60^\\circ, 180^\\circ, 300^\\circ$"
msgstr "センサー物理座標 $p_{sen}$: $60^\\circ, 180^\\circ, 300^\\circ$"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_active_damping.ipynb:40012
#: fd85d1afe55c46628acfff404a2bb3bb
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"We define the transformation matrices $T_{act}, T_{sen}$ for each and "
"incorporate them into the state-space model."
msgstr "それぞれの変換行列 $T_{act}, T_{sen}$ を定義し、状態空間モデルに組み込みます。"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_active_damping.ipynb:60002
#: 49cd99a4bc07473c95f864166cac4064
msgid "2. MIMO Transfer Function Measurement"
msgstr "2\\. MIMO伝達関数の測定"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_active_damping.ipynb:60004
#: bc61b00651c54684b84ae80a408fac2f
msgid ""
"Since the sensor and actuator positions differ, strong responses should "
"appear not only in the diagonal components (ACT1->SEN1) but also in the off-"
"diagonal components."
msgstr "センサーとアクチュエータの位置が異なるため、対角成分（ACT1->SEN1）だけでなく、非対角成分にも強い応答が現れるはずです。"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_active_damping.ipynb:80002
#: f5cdfc18046e4a64a074a8870eef5bdc
msgid "3 & 4. Modal Control Design"
msgstr "3 & 4. モード制御系の設計 (Modal Control Design)"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_active_damping.ipynb:80004
#: b7f3837e8ff14ac0bc162d9a0aa5d6ff
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Since the actuator and sensor positions do not coincide, simple "
"decentralized control ($F_i \\propto \\dot{y}_i$) may become unstable. "
"Therefore, we adopt a method that **estimates modal displacement from sensor"
" signals using transformation matrices, applies damping in modal space, and "
"then distributes the result to actuator forces**."
msgstr ""
"アクチュエータとセンサーの位置が一致していないため、単純な分散制御（$F_i \\propto \\dot{y}_i$）では不安定になる恐れがあります。"
" そこで、**座標変換行列を用いてセンサー信号からモード変位を推定し、モード空間でダンピングをかけた後、アクチュエータ推力に分配する** "
"手法を採ります。"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_active_damping.ipynb:80007
#: fc54ae914b7b476e979920564d59537b
msgid "**Control Flow:**"
msgstr "**制御フロー:**"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_active_damping.ipynb:80008
#: b42b73c873d34e74a9e6aa954aea256c
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Sensing**: Estimate modal displacement $q$ from sensor output $y$ $$ "
"q_{est} = T_{sen}^{-1} y $$"
msgstr ""
"**センシング**: センサ出力 $y$ からモード変位 $q$ を推定します $$ q_{est} = T_{sen}^{-1} y $$"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_active_damping.ipynb:80010
#: 56721d20fb0d4bc1ac065d99d405f7f7
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Modal Damping**: Apply pseudo-derivative filter $K(s)$ to each mode to "
"calculate modal force $F_{modal}$ $$ F_{modal} = -K_{modal}(s) q_{est} $$"
msgstr ""
"**モード制振**: 各モードに擬似微分フィルタ $K(s)$ を適用し、モード力 $F_{modal}$ を計算します $$ F_{modal} = "
"-K_{modal}(s) q_{est} $$"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_active_damping.ipynb:80012
#: 4f5f00063edb43208ec7ad68799897d4
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Actuation**: Distribute modal force $F_{modal}$ to actuator forces $u$ $$ "
"u = (T_{act}^T)^{-1} F_{modal} $$"
msgstr ""
"**アクチュエーション**: モード力 $F_{modal}$ をアクチュエータ力 $u$ に分配します $$ u = (T_{act}^T)^{-1}"
" F_{modal} $$"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_active_damping.ipynb:80015
#: bdc0c51f50b941b48cdeca0f6d99ec8d
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Overall, the MIMO controller $K_{MIMO}$ becomes: $$ K_{MIMO}(s) = "
"(T_{act}^T)^{-1} \\cdot \\mathrm{diag}(K_{z}(s), K_{\\theta x}(s), "
"K_{\\theta y}(s)) \\cdot T_{sen}^{-1} $$"
msgstr ""
"全体として、MIMO コントローラ $K_{MIMO}$ は次のようになります： $$ K_{MIMO}(s) = (T_{act}^T)^{-1} "
"\\cdot \\mathrm{diag}(K_{z}(s), K_{\\theta x}(s), K_{\\theta y}(s)) \\cdot "
"T_{sen}^{-1} $$"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_active_damping.ipynb:100002
#: 6bd420707bcc4417b2fb347535efb0bf
msgid "5 & 6. Closed-Loop Verification (Impulse Response & ASD)"
msgstr "5 & 6. 閉ループ検証 (インパルス応答 & ASD)"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_active_damping.ipynb:100004
#: afc42e3bf00d440aa12fa993367ebce4
msgid ""
"Using the constructed modal control system, we perform closed-loop "
"simulation. We verify the response to an impulse disturbance on actuator 1 "
"and to steady-state ground vibration on all axes."
msgstr ""
"構築したモード制御系を用いて、閉ループシミュレーションを行います。 "
"アクチュエータ1へのインパルス外乱、および全軸への定常地面振動に対する応答を確認します。"
